# 统一行尾与编码：Java/YAML/SQL/Markdown 一律 LF + UTF-8，避免 Windows 下 CRLF 噪音
* text=auto eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.docx binary
*.jar binary
